---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Icon from '../components/home/Icon.astro';
import TattooBand from '../components/home/TattooBand.astro';
import '../styles/custom-guides.css';
import AccommodationDirectory from '../components/AccommodationDirectory.astro';
import { staySources } from '../data/accommodations';
---
<BaseLayout title="Places to Stay in Pohnpei | Hotels & Direct Contacts"
  description="Compare ten Pohnpei hotels by area and published amenities. Find direct phone and email contacts, questions to ask before booking, and official tourism resources."
  canonical="https://pohnpeiisland.com/places-to-stay">
  <a href="#stay-guide" class="skip-link">Skip to accommodation guide</a>
  <Nav />
  <main id="stay-guide" tabindex="-1" class="custom-guide">
    <section class="custom-guide-hero custom-guide-hero--editorial">
      <div class="custom-guide-hero-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="custom-guide-kicker">Pohnpei / Plan your stay</p>
          <h1 class="custom-guide-heading">A place to stay.<br /><em class="text-ochre-deep">An island to know.</em></h1>
          <p class="custom-guide-intro">Find a base for your time in Pohnpei. Explore the places, compare the practical details, and start a conversation with the people who’ll welcome you.</p>
          <a href="#stays" class="guide-button bg-basalt text-sand hover:bg-lagoon mt-8">Explore places to stay <Icon name="down" /></a>
        </div>
        <aside class="custom-guide-aside">
          <p class="eyebrow">Before you choose</p>
          <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl mb-4">Start with your days.</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-basalt/80 leading-relaxed mb-5">Think about the trips you want to take, where you’ll eat, and how you’ll get around. Then ask a property how it can support your plans.</p>
          <div class="flex gap-8 border-t border-basalt/20 pt-5"><p><strong class="font-headline text-4xl font-normal">10</strong><span class="block text-xs mt-1">Places listed</span></p><p><strong class="font-headline text-4xl font-normal">2</strong><span class="block text-xs mt-1">Areas: Kolonia &amp; Nett</span></p></div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    <TattooBand class="custom-guide-border-places-to-stay" variant="fish" />
    </section>
    <div class="custom-guide-context px-6 py-5 bg-sand-bright border-y border-basalt/15">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-basalt/80 leading-relaxed">
        <p>Independent guide · <a href={staySources.tourism} class="text-link">Official tourism accommodation directory <Icon name="arrow" /></a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="On this page" class="custom-guide-toc px-6 border-b border-basalt/15"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 py-2 text-sm"><a href="#stays" class="page-link">01 / Compare stays</a><a href="#booking-checklist" class="page-link">02 / Before you book</a><a href="#island-days" class="page-link">03 / Plan your days</a><a href="#stay-sources" class="page-link">About this guide</a></div></nav>
    <AccommodationDirectory />
    <section id="booking-checklist" class="guide-section bg-sand">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_1.5fr] gap-10 md:gap-20">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">02 / Before you book</p><h2 class="section-title mb-6">A good stay starts<br />with <em>a few questions.</em></h2><p class="text-basalt/80 leading-relaxed">Send your dates, number of guests, and room requirements. Ask for written confirmation of the room and terms before making your arrangements.</p></div>
        <dl class="bg-sand-bright px-6 md:px-8 divide-y divide-basalt/15">
          <div class="py-6"><dt class="font-headline text-2xl mb-2">The full price</dt><dd>What is the total for your stay, including taxes, extra guests, meals, and transfers? What deposit, payment method, and cancellation terms apply?</dd></div>
          <div class="py-6"><dt class="font-headline text-2xl mb-2">Arrival &amp; getting around</dt><dd>Share your flight details. Confirm pickup, its cost, a meeting point, and a contact if your arrival changes. Ask for the property’s exact location and how to arrange daily transport.</dd></div>
          <div class="py-6"><dt class="font-headline text-2xl mb-2">The room you need</dt><dd>Confirm beds, hot water, air conditioning, internet coverage, and cooking facilities for the actual room offered. Mention children’s ages and any access needs; ask about steps, bathrooms, and assistance.</dd></div>
          <div class="py-6"><dt class="font-headline text-2xl mb-2">Meals &amp; days out</dt><dd>Ask which meals are served during your dates and how to reach other dining options. Agree on tour pickup and return arrangements separately.</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="island-days" class="guide-section bg-basalt text-sand">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-20 items-center">
        <div><p class="text-xs tracking-[.18em] uppercase mb-5 text-sand/75">03 / Beyond your room</p><h2 class="font-headline text-4xl md:text-5xl leading-tight mb-5">Make room for<br /><em>Nan Madol.</em></h2><p class="text-sand/85 leading-relaxed">Once you’ve shortlisted a stay, share its location with a local guide. Work out the route, pickup, tide timing, and return trip together.</p><a href="/nan-madol" class="guide-button bg-sand text-basalt hover:bg-sand-bright mt-7">Explore the Nan Madol guide <Icon name="arrow" /></a><a href="/tour-operators" class="block py-4 text-sm underline underline-offset-4">Find guides &amp; transport <Icon name="arrow" /></a><a href="/plan-your-trip" class="block py-4 text-sm underline underline-offset-4">Follow the planning steps <Icon name="arrow" /></a></div>
        <div class="border-t border-sand/30 pt-7"><h3 class="font-headline text-3xl mb-4">Make the next connection.</h3><div class="divide-y divide-sand/25"><a class="block py-5 text-sm underline underline-offset-4" href="/nan-madol#local-guides">Contact local Nan Madol guides <Icon name="arrow" /></a><a class="block py-5 text-sm underline underline-offset-4" href="/getting-here">Plan your journey to Pohnpei <Icon name="arrow" /></a><a class="block py-5 text-sm underline underline-offset-4" href={staySources.contact}>Ask the Pohnpei Tourism Office <Icon name="arrow" /></a></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="stay-sources" class="guide-section bg-sand-bright">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 md:gap-20">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">About the guide</p><h2 class="section-title mb-6">Useful details.<br /><em>Clear sources.</em></h2><p class="text-sm text-basalt/80 leading-relaxed mb-5">PohnpeiIsland.com is independent and has no formal tourism-office affiliation. This guide covers the ten main-island properties in the official accommodation directory. It is a starting point, not a list of every possible stay.</p><p class="text-sm text-basalt/80 leading-relaxed">For homestays, vacation rentals, or outer-island arrangements, <a href={staySources.contact} class="text-link">ask the tourism office</a> about current options and local contacts.</p></div>
        <div class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-basalt/80">
          <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl text-basalt mb-4">How to read the listings</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Names, areas, and primary contacts follow the <a class="text-link" href={staySources.tourism}>Pohnpei Tourism Office directory</a>. Property websites supply additional details where available.</p>
          <p class="mb-4">Some room and amenity information comes from <a class="text-link" href={staySources.wcpfc}>WCPFC’s June 2025 accommodation sheet (PDF)</a>. Those listings carry a dated note. Reviewing a source today does not make its older information newly confirmed.</p>
          <p class="mb-4">We have not inspected the properties or confirmed room availability. Contact links open your phone or email app, or take you to a property website. Bookings and payments are arranged directly with the property.</p>
          <p>See something that needs checking? The source links are included with each listing; confirm changes with the property or <a class="text-link" href={staySources.contact}>the tourism office</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
